  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4602.11 Automated data acquisition and handling system (DAHS)",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.11 “Automated data acquisition and handling system (DAHS)” means that component of the continuous emissions monitoring system, or other emissions monitoring system approved for use under Env-A 4609, designed to interpret and convert individual output signals from pollutant concentration monitors, flow monitors, diluent gas monitors, and other component parts of the monitoring system to produce a continuous record of the measured parameters in the measurement units required by Env-A 4609.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.10); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4600.html"
